{"time": "2026-05-17 12:08:22.881283+07:00", "level": "INFO", "message": "TRACE api.request.received", "module": "core.trace", "function": "trace_event", "line": 60, "request_id": "req_205efb9d8544", "http_method": "POST", "http_path": "/v1/messages", "stage": "ingress", "event": "api.request.received", "source": "api", "message_count": 15, "snapshot": {"model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "<system-reminder>\nThe following skills are available for use with the Skill tool:\n\n- update-config: Use this skill to configure the Claude Code harness via settings.json. Automated behaviors (\"from now on when X\", \"each time X\", \"whenever X\", \"before/after X\") require hooks configured in settings.json - the harness executes these, not Claude, so memory/preferences cannot fulfill them. Also use for: permissions (\"allow X\", \"add permission\", \"move permission to\"), env vars (\"set X=Y\"), hook troubleshooting, or any changes to settings.json/settings.local.json files. Examples: \"allow npm commands\", \"add bq permission to global settings\", \"move permission to user settings\", \"set DEBUG=true\", \"when claude stops show X\". For simple settings like theme/model, suggest the /config command.\n- keybindings-help: Use when the user wants to customize keyboard shortcuts, rebind keys, add chord bindings, or modify ~/.claude/keybindings.json. Examples: \"rebind ctrl+s\", \"add a chord shortcut\", \"change the submit key\", \"customize keybindings\".\n- simplify: Review changed code for reuse, quality, and efficiency, then fix any issues found.\n- fewer-permission-prompts: Scan your transcripts for common read-only Bash and MCP tool calls, then add a prioritized allowlist to project .claude/settings.json to reduce permission prompts.\n- loop: Run a prompt or slash command on a recurring interval (e.g. /loop 5m /foo). Omit the interval to let the model self-pace. - When the user wants to set up a recurring task, poll for status, or run something repeatedly on an interval (e.g. \"check the deploy every 5 minutes\", \"keep running /babysit-prs\"). Do NOT invoke for one-off tasks.\n- claude-api: Build, debug, and optimize Claude API / Anthropic SDK apps. Apps built with this skill should include prompt caching. Also handles migrating existing Claude API code between Claude model versions (4.5 \u2192 4.6, 4.6 \u2192 4.7, retired-model replacements).\nTRIGGER when: code imports `anthropic`/`@anthropic-ai/sdk`; user asks for the Claude API, Anthropic SDK, or Managed Agents; user adds/modifies/tunes a Claude feature (caching, thinking, compaction, tool use, batch, files, citations, memory) or model (Opus/Sonnet/Haiku) in a file; questions about prompt caching / cache hit rate in an Anthropic SDK project.\nSKIP: file imports `openai`/other-provider SDK, filename like `*-openai.py`/`*-generic.py`, provider-neutral code, general programming/ML.\n- init: Initialize a new CLAUDE.md file with codebase documentation\n- review: Review a pull request\n- security-review: Complete a security review of the pending changes on the current branch\n</system-reminder>"}, {"type": "text", "text": "<system-reminder>\n## Exited Plan Mode\n\nYou have exited plan mode. You can now make edits, run tools, and take actions.\n</system-reminder>\n"}, {"type": "text", "text": "<system-reminder>\nAs you answer the user's questions, you can use the following context:\n# currentDate\nToday's date is 2026-05-17.\n\n      IMPORTANT: this context may or may not be relevant to your tasks. You should not respond to this context unless it is highly relevant to your task.\n</system-reminder>\n\n"}, {"type": "text", "text": "<local-command-caveat>Caveat: The messages below were generated by the user while running local commands. DO NOT respond to these messages or otherwise consider them in your response unless the user explicitly asks you to.</local-command-caveat>\n"}, {"type": "text", "text": "<command-name>/model</command-name>\n            <command-message>model</command-message>\n            <command-args></command-args>\n"}, {"type": "text", "text": "<local-command-stdout>Set model to \u001b[1mOpus 4.7\u001b[22m</local-command-stdout>\n"}, {"type": "text", "text": "<local-command-caveat>Caveat: The messages below were generated by the user while running local commands. DO NOT respond to these messages or otherwise consider them in your response unless the user explicitly asks you to.</local-command-caveat>\n"}, {"type": "text", "text": "<command-name>/plan</command-name>\n            <command-message>plan</command-message>\n            <command-args></command-args>\n"}, {"type": "text", "text": "<local-command-stdout>Enabled plan mode</local-command-stdout>\n"}, {"type": "text", "text": "<command-name>/agents</command-name>\n            <command-message>agents</command-message>\n            <command-args></command-args>\n"}, {"type": "text", "text": "<local-command-stdout>Agents dialog dismissed</local-command-stdout>\n"}, {"type": "text", "text": "Implementasikan fitur ganti lagu di halaman hasil dengan model batch, bukan realtime per klik. User harus bisa menandai beberapa lagu dulu untuk diganti, lalu sistem baru memproses semuanya saat tombol Ganti lagu terpilih ditekan. Hanya lagu yang dipilih user yang boleh dikeluarkan; lagu lain tetap dipertahankan kecuali penyesuaian urutan setelah hasil akhir dirapikan. Saat diproses, sistem harus mengecualikan lagu-lagu yang dibuang agar tidak muncul lagi pada proses penggantian berikutnya di session hasil yang sama, menghitung total durasi yang hilang, lalu mencari pengganti dari kandidat yang tersisa berdasarkan ranking/EDAS yang sudah ada sambil tetap mendekati target durasi playlist. Pengganti boleh berupa satu lagu atau kombinasi beberapa lagu jika itu lebih cocok. Jika tidak ada kombinasi ideal, pilih kandidat terdekat yang paling masuk akal tanpa melenceng jauh dari target durasi. Setelah proses selesai, playlist diperbarui sekali saja dalam satu batch, urutan dirapikan kembali, dan user tetap boleh melakukan batch penggantian lagi pada hasil yang sudah diperbarui. Perlakukan ini sebagai modifikasi dari hasil/session yang sedang aktif, bukan generate hasil baru dari nol. Jangan ubah flow EDAS utama, NLG, history, export platform eksternal, tema, atau area lain."}], "reasoning_content": null}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "We need to implement batch song replacement in the \"hasil\" page (result). The user wants to select multiple songs to replace, then press a button to process all at once, with replacement based on batch/EDAS ranking, preserving others, adjusting order after removal, recalculating total duration, picking replacements either single or multiple from remaining candidates, trying to keep target duration.\n\nWe need to modify the hasil page (frontend/src/app/hasil/page.tsx and related CSS/module) and perhaps the backend logic? The feature is client-side? But likely need to adjust state and send batch request to backend (maybe a new endpoint). However instruction says \"Jangan ubah flow EDAS utama, NLG, history, export platform eksternal, tema, atau area lain.\" So we should not change main EDAS flow; we just modify hasil page to implement batch replacement using existing data (ranking/EDAS) that is already present (maybe from server). The hasil page likely shows playlist with songs, each having a checkbox for selection, and a \"Ganti lagu terpilih\" button.\n\nWe need to check existing code. Let's first read the hasil page files.\n\nWe'll need to navigate to the project root: C:\\Users\\Haikal\\Documents\\SKRIPSI\\GANTI JUDUL\\KODINGNYA\n\nLet's start by reading the hasil page.\n", "signature": ""}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "chatcmpl-tool-b4e5ba36f719104b", "name": "Read", "input": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\Haikal\\Documents\\SKRIPSI\\GANTI JUDUL\\KODINGNYA\\frontend\\src\\app\\hasil\\page.tsx"}}], "reasoning_content": null}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b4e5ba36f719104b", "content": "1\t\"use client\";\n2\t\n3\timport { useEffect, useMemo, useState } from \"react\";\n4\timport { useRouter } from \"next/navigation\";\n5\timport Link from \"next/link\";\n6\timport { MusicBackground } from \"@/components/common/MusicBackground\";\n7\timport { MusicCursorTrail } from \"@/components/common/MusicCursorTrail\";\n8\timport { getOrCreateClientId } from \"@/lib/clientId\";\n9\timport styles from \"./page.module.css\";\n10\t\n11\tconst RESULT_STORAGE_KEY = \"playlist-result-v1\";\n12\tconst THEME_STORAGE_KEY = \"playlist-theme-v1\";\n13\tconst EXT_PREFIX = \"ext-url-v2\";\n14\t\n15\ttype ContextData = {\n16\t  activity: string;\n17\t  timeOfDay: string;\n18\t  mood: string;\n19\t  durationMinutes: number;\n20\t};\n21\t\n22\ttype PlaylistItem = {\n23\t  rank: number;\n24\t  id_song?: number;\n25\t  title: string;\n26\t  artist: string;\n27\t  durationSec: number;\n28\t  appraisalScore: number;\n29\t};\n30\t\n31\ttype ResultData = {\n32\t  context: ContextData;\n33\t  playlist: PlaylistItem[];\n34\t  summary: {\n35\t    targetDurationSec: number;\n36\t    totalDurationSec: number;\n37\t    selectedSongs: number;\n38\t  };\n39\t  nlgText: string;\n40\t  nlgMeta?: {\n41\t    source?: string;\n42\t    model?: string;\n43\t    fallbackUsed?: boolean;\n44\t    reason?: string | null;\n45\t  };\n46\t};\n47\t\n48\ttype HistorySong = {\n49\t  id_song: number;\n50\t  title: string;\n51\t  artist: string;\n52\t  rank_order: number;\n53\t  appraisal_score: number;\n54\t};\n55\t\n56\ttype HistorySession = {\n57\t  id_session: number;\n58\t  activity: string;\n59\t  time_category: string;\n60\t  mood: string;\n61\t  duration_target: number;\n62\t  created_at: string;\n63\t  songs: HistorySong[];\n64\t};\n65\t\n66\t// Format durasi ke mm:ss\n67\tfunction formatDuration(sec: number): string {\n68\t  const m = Math.floor(sec / 60);\n69\t  const s = sec % 60;\n70\t  return `${m}:${String(s).padStart(2, \"0\")}`;\n71\t}\n72\t\n73\tfunction generatePlaylistName(ctx: ContextData): string {\n74\t  return `${ctx.activity} \u2022 ${ctx.mood} \u2022 ${ctx.timeOfDay}`;\n75\t}\n76\t\n77\tfunction playlistFingerprint(tracks: PlaylistItem[]): string {\n78\t  const data = tracks.map((t) => `${t.title}|${t.artist}`).sort().join(\"||\");\n79\t  let hash = 0;\n80\t  for (let i = 0; i < data.length; i++) {\n81\t    const ch = data.charCodeAt(i);\n82\t    hash = ((hash << 5) - hash) + ch;\n83\t    hash |= 0;\n84\t  }\n85\t  return Math.abs(hash).toString(36);\n86\t}\n87\t\n88\texport default function HasilPage() {\n89\t  const router = useRouter();\n90\t  const [spotifyLoading, setSpotifyLoading] = useState(false);\n91\t  const [youtubeLoading, setYoutubeLoading] = useState(false);\n92\t  const [historyItems, setHistoryItems] = useState<HistorySession[]>([]);\n93\t  const [historyLoading, setHistoryLoading] = useState(true);\n94\t  const [historyError, setHistoryError] = useState<string | null>(null);\n95\t  const [selectedSessionId, setSelectedSessionId] = useState<number | null>(null);\n96\t\n97\t  // Ambil hasil rekomendasi dari localStorage\n98\t  useEffect(() => {\n99\t    const saved = localStorage.getItem(THEME_STORAGE_KEY);\n100\t    document.documentElement.dataset.theme = saved === \"light\" ? \"light\" : \"dark\";\n101\t  }, []);\n102\t\n103\t  // Ambil status koneksi Spotify/YouTube dan riwayat rekomendasi\n104\t  useEffect(() => {\n105\t    const clientId = getOrCreateClientId();\n106\t    void fetch(`/api/recommendations/history?clientId=${encodeURIComponent(clientId)}`)\n107\t      .then((response) => response.json() as Promise<{ history: HistorySession[]; error?: string }>)\n108\t      .then((payload) => {\n109\t        setHistoryItems(payload.history ?? []);\n110\t        if (payload.error) {\n111\t          setHistoryError(payload.error);\n112\t        }\n113\t      })\n114\t      .catch(() => {\n115\t        setHistoryError(\"Gagal memuat riwayat rekomendasi.\");\n116\t      })\n117\t      .finally(() => {\n118\t        setHistoryLoading(false);\n119\t      });\n120\t  }, []);\n121\t\n122\t  // Status koneksi Spotify/YouTube tidak perlu dicek \u2014\n123\t  // server menggunakan token project akun tetap (kalskripdas@gmail.com).\n124\t\n125\t  const result = useMemo(() => {\n126\t    if (globalThis.window === undefined) return null;\n127\t    const raw = localStorage.getItem(RESULT_STORAGE_KEY);\n128\t    if (!raw) return null;\n129\t    return JSON.parse(raw) as ResultData;\n130\t  }, []);\n131\t\n132\t  const selectedSession = useMemo(\n133\t    () => historyItems.find((session) => session.id_session === selectedSessionId) ?? null,\n134\t    [historyItems, selectedSessionId],\n135\t  );\n136\t\n137\t  const showNlgDebug =\n138\t    process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_NLG_DEBUG === \"true\" || process.env.NODE_ENV !== \"production\";\n139\t\n140\t  if (!result) {\n141\t    return (\n142\t      <main className={styles.fallback}>\n143\t        <h1>Data hasil belum tersedia</h1>\n144\t        <p>Mulai dari halaman awal dulu ya.</p>\n145\t        <Link href=\"/\">Ke Beranda</Link>\n146\t      </main>\n147\t    );\n148\t  }\n149\t\n150\t  const overDuration = Math.max(0, result.summary.totalDurationSec - result.summary.targetDurationSec);\n151\t\n152\t  const fp = useMemo(() => playlistFingerprint(result.playlist), [result.playlist]);\n153\t  const extKeySpotify = `${EXT_PREFIX}-spotify-${fp}`;\n154\t  const extKeyYoutube = `${EXT_PREFIX}-youtube-${fp}`;\n155\t\n156\t  const redirectToUrl = (url: string) => {\n157\t    window.location.href = url;\n158\t  };\n159\t\n160\t  const openOrCreate = async (platform: \"spotify\" | \"youtube\") => {\n161\t    const extKey = platform === \"spotify\" ? extKeySpotify : extKeyYoutube;\n162\t    const setLoading = platform === \"spotify\" ? setSpotifyLoading : setYoutubeLoading;\n163\t    const endpoint = platform === \"spotify\" ? \"/api/spotify/project-export\" : \"/api/youtube/project-export\";\n164\t    const label = platform === \"spotify\" ? \"Spotify\" : \"YouTube\";\n165\t\n166\t    setLoading(true);\n167\t    try {\n168\t      const cached = localStorage.getItem(extKey);\n169\t      if (cached) {\n170\t        console.log(`[${label} Export] Reuse existing ${label} playlist \u2014 ${cached}`);\n171\t        redirectToUrl(cached);\n172\t        return;\n173\t      }\n174\t\n175\t      console.log(`[${label} Export] No cached URL \u2014 creating new playlist`);\n176\t      const playlistName = generatePlaylistName(result.context);\n177\t      const res = await fetch(endpoint, {\n178\t        method: \"POST\",\n179\t        headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n180\t        body: JSON.stringify({\n181\t          playlistName,\n182\t          tracks: result.playlist.map((s) => ({ title: s.title, artist: s.artist })),\n183\t        }),\n184\t      });\n185\t      const data = await res.json();\n186\t      if (data.status === \"success\" && data.publicUrl) {\n187\t        localStorage.setItem(extKey, data.publicUrl);\n188\t        console.log(`[${label} Export] Created new playlist \u2014 ${data.publicUrl}`);\n189\t        redirectToUrl(data.publicUrl);\n190\t      } else {\n191\t        alert(data.error || `Gagal export ke ${label}.`);\n192\t      }\n193\t    } catch {\n194\t      alert(`Gagal export ke ${label}.`);\n195\t    } finally {\n196\t      setLoading(false);\n197\t    }\n198\t  };\n199\t\n200\t  const handleExportSpotify = () => openOrCreate(\"spotify\");\n201\t  const handleExportYoutube = () => openOrCreate(\"youtube\");\n202\t\n203\t  const handleSelesai = () => {\n204\t    router.push(\"/\");\n205\t  };\n206\t\n207\t  const handleOpenHistory = (sessionId: number) => {\n208\t    setSelectedSessionId(sessionId);\n209\t  };\n210\t\n211\t  const handleCloseHistory = () => {\n212\t    setSelectedSessionId(null);\n213\t  };\n214\t\n215\t  return (\n216\t    <main className={styles.page}>\n217\t      <MusicBackground />\n218\t      <MusicCursorTrail />\n219\t\n220\t      <section className={styles.layout}>\n221\t        <header className={styles.topBar}>\n222\t          <Link href=\"/\" className={styles.backLink}>\u2190 Kembali ke beranda</Link>\n223\t          <span className={styles.badge}>Hasil Rekomendasi</span>\n224\t        </header>\n225\t\n226\t        <section className={styles.card}>\n227\t          <h1>Hasil rekomendasi playlist</h1>\n228\t          <p>\n229\t            Konteks: <strong>{result.context.activity}</strong> \u00b7 {result.context.timeOfDay} \u00b7 suasana saat ini {result.context.mood}\n230\t          </p>\n231\t\n232\t          <div className={styles.metrics}>\n233\t            <span>Target: {formatDuration(result.summary.targetDurationSec)}</span>\n234\t            <span>Total: {formatDuration(result.summary.totalDurationSec)}</span>\n235\t            <span>Lagu: {result.summary.selectedSongs}</span>\n236\t            <span>Kelebihan: {formatDuration(overDuration)}</span>\n237\t          </div>\n238\t        </section>\n239\t\n240\t        <section className={styles.card}>\n241\t          <h2>Top playlist (ranking EDAS)</h2>\n242\t          <ul className={styles.songList}>\n243\t            {result.playlist.map((song) => (\n244\t              <li key={`${song.rank}-${song.title}`}>\n245\t                <div>\n246\t                  <strong>#{song.rank} {song.title}</strong>\n247\t                  <p>{song.artist}</p>\n248\t                </div>\n249\t                <div className={styles.songMeta}>\n250\t                  <span>{formatDuration(song.durationSec)}</span>\n251\t                  <span>AS {song.appraisalScore.toFixed(4)}</span>\n252\t                </div>\n253\t              </li>\n254\t            ))}\n255\t          </ul>\n256\t        </section>\n257\t\n258\t        <section className={styles.card}>\n259\t          <h2>Penjelasan rekomendasi</h2>\n260\t          <p className={styles.nlgText}>{result.nlgText}</p>\n261\t          {showNlgDebug && result.nlgMeta && (\n262\t            <div className={styles.nlgMeta}>\n263\t              <span className={styles.nlgBadge}>Source: {result.nlgMeta.source ?? \"unknown\"}</span>\n264\t              {result.nlgMeta.model && (\n265\t                <span className={styles.nlgBadge}>Model: {result.nlgMeta.model}</span>\n266\t              )}\n267\t              {typeof result.nlgMeta.fallbackUsed === \"boolean\" && (\n268\t                <span className={styles.nlgBadge}>\n269\t                  Fallback: {result.nlgMeta.fallbackUsed ? \"yes\" : \"no\"}\n270\t                </span>\n271\t              )}\n272\t            </div>\n273\t          )}\n274\t        </section>\n275\t\n276\t        <section className={styles.card}>\n277\t          <h2>Riwayat rekomendasi terbaru</h2>\n278\t          {historyLoading && <p>Memuat riwayat...</p>}\n279\t          {!historyLoading && historyError && <p>{historyError}</p>}\n280\t          {!historyLoading && !historyError && historyItems.length === 0 && (\n281\t            <p>Belum ada riwayat rekomendasi untuk perangkat ini.</p>\n282\t          )}\n283\t          {!historyLoading && !historyError && historyItems.length > 0 && (\n284\t            <ul className={styles.historyList}>\n285\t              {historyItems.map((session) => (\n286\t                <li key={session.id_session} className={styles.historyItem}>\n287\t                  <button\n288\t                    type=\"button\"\n289\t                    className={styles.historyButton}\n290\t                    onClick={() => handleOpenHistory(session.id_session)}\n291\t                  >\n292\t                    <div className={styles.historyTitle}>\n293\t                      <span>\n294\t                        <strong>{session.activity}</strong> \u00b7 {session.time_category} \u00b7 suasana saat ini {session.mood}\n295\t                      </span>\n296\t                      <span className={styles.historyAction}>Lihat detail</span>\n297\t                    </div>\n298\t                    <div className={styles.historyMeta}>\n299\t                      <span>Target {formatDuration(session.duration_target * 60)}</span>\n300\t                      <span>{new Date(session.created_at).toLocaleString(\"id-ID\")}</span>\n301\t                    </div>\n302\t                    {session.songs.length > 0 && (\n303\t                      <div className={styles.historyPreview}>\n304\t                        {session.songs.slice(0, 3).map((song) => (\n305\t                          <span key={`${session.id_session}-${song.id_song}-${song.rank_order}`}>\n306\t                            #{song.rank_order} {song.title}\n307\t                          </span>\n308\t                        ))}\n309\t                      </div>\n310\t                    )}\n311\t                  </button>\n312\t                </li>\n313\t              ))}\n314\t            </ul>\n315\t          )}\n316\t        </section>\n317\t\n318\t        {selectedSession && (\n319\t          <div className={styles.historyOverlay}>\n320\t            <button\n321\t              type=\"button\"\n322\t              className={styles.historyBackdrop}\n323\t              onClick={handleCloseHistory}\n324\t              aria-label=\"Tutup detail riwayat\"\n325\t            />\n326\t            <dialog open className={styles.historyModal} onCancel={handleCloseHistory}>\n327\t              <header className={styles.historyModalHeader}>\n328\t                <h3>Detail riwayat rekomendasi</h3>\n329\t                <button type=\"button\" className={styles.historyCloseButton} onClick={handleCloseHistory}>\n330\t                  Tutup\n331\t                </button>\n332\t              </header>\n333\t              <div className={styles.historyModalBody}>\n334\t                <p className={styles.historyContext}>\n335\t                  <strong>{selectedSession.activity}</strong> \u00b7 {selectedSession.time_category} \u00b7 suasana saat ini {selectedSession.mood}\n336\t                </p>\n337\t                <div className={styles.historyModalMeta}>\n338\t                  <span>Target {formatDuration(selectedSession.duration_target * 60)}</span>\n339\t                  <span>{new Date(selectedSession.created_at).toLocaleString(\"id-ID\")}</span>\n340\t                </div>\n341\t                <ul className={styles.historyModalList}>\n342\t                  {selectedSession.songs.map((song) => (\n343\t                    <li key={`${selectedSession.id_session}-${song.id_song}-${song.rank_order}`}>\n344\t                      <span>#{song.rank_order}</span>\n345\t                      <span>{song.title}</span>\n346\t                      <span>{song.artist}</span>\n347\t                    </li>\n348\t                  ))}\n349\t                </ul>\n350\t              </div>\n351\t            </dialog>\n352\t          </div>\n353\t        )}\n354\t\n355\t        <section className={styles.card}>\n356\t          <h2>Simpan ke platform musik</h2>\n357\t          <p style={{ marginBottom: 12 }}>Buka playlist hasil rekomendasi langsung di platform favoritmu.</p>\n358\t\n359\t          <div className={styles.platformGrid}>\n360\t            <div className={styles.platformCard}>\n361\t              <div className={styles.platformHeader}>\n362\t                <span className={styles.platformIcon}>\ud83c\udfa7</span>\n363\t                <span className={styles.platformName}>Spotify</span>\n364\t              </div>\n365\t              <button\n366\t                type=\"button\"\n367\t                className={styles.primaryButton}\n368\t                onClick={handleExportSpotify}\n369\t                disabled={spotifyLoading}\n370\t              >\n371\t                {spotifyLoading && <span className={styles.spinner} />}\n372\t                {spotifyLoading ? \"Membuka playlist...\" : \"Buka di Spotify\"}\n373\t              </button>\n374\t            </div>\n375\t